From a7c6537d0ba05ec2863839003bb7f094c4003d90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arian <arian.kulmer@web.de>
Date: Tue, 15 Oct 2024 01:44:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Start gallery as a new task

When launched from lockscreen user will have to unlock for the gallery to be opened, then the gallery is living in the camera process which is wrong.
Let it create a new task for it.

[genie1997: re-made for the 6.4 GalleryHelper intent builder]
Signed-off-by: genie1997 <genie1997.dev@gmail.com>
---
 smali/A/c3.smali | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali/A/c3.smali b/smali/A/c3.smali
index b712d78b..18fd07ee 100644
--- a/smali/A/c3.smali
+++ b/smali/A/c3.smali
@@ -143,6 +143,11 @@
     invoke-virtual {v1, p2, v2}, Landroid/content/Intent;->putExtra(Ljava/lang/String;Z)Landroid/content/Intent;
 
     :goto_1
+    # FLAG_ACTIVITY_NEW_TASK
+    const p2, 0x10000000
+
+    invoke-virtual {v1, p2}, Landroid/content/Intent;->addFlags(I)Landroid/content/Intent;
+
     invoke-virtual {v0}, LG7/b;->a()Z
 
     move-result p2
-- 
2.53.0

